# The pass WITHOUT Odyssey (TESTS.md T2), selected by name:
#
#   -DepMap wsl-deps.sans-odyssey.map -Filter 05-sans-odyssey.feature
#
# A line starting with '!' leaves that DLC out of ModsConfig for this pass. Its Data folder stays,
